  storyText: "The Mall\n\nInside the dead mall, two Voodoo Boys step out of the shadows, pistols lazy in their hands. \"Wrong place, stranger.\"\n\n1. Show them the shard.\n2. \"Kaz Okoro sent me.\"\n3. Try to sneak past."
